Z||000003||Fierowrecker||03-12-2001||08:37 AM||||It is easy...<BR>Look for spare facias at kitcar builders...<BR>Usually you can get them cheep...||||reg||1
Z||000004||Tigger||03-12-2001||09:02 AM||||I'm assuming you mean the "Aero" facias.  For '84 you need the facias with ribbed moulding to match the rest of the car.  '84 Indys and '85 GT's have this moulding, later years the trim was smooth.<P>The "crunch" panel behind the facia can be trimmed down to fit, however you may compromise safety.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> j/k<P>This has been a popular topic, try searching older threads.||||reg||1
